== Wikitext Help ==

Writing articles is easy! Use the following syntax:

=== Formatting ===
* '''Bold''': <code>'''Bold Text'''</code>
* ''Italic'': <code>''Italic Text''</code>
* <hr/> : <code>----</code>

=== Headers ===
* <code>== Header 2 ==</code>
* <code>=== Header 3 ===</code>

=== Links ===
* Internal: <code>[[Main Page]]</code> or <code>[[Main Page|Custom Label]]</code>
* External: <code>[https://google.com Google]</code>

=== Lists ===
* Bullet points: <code>* Item</code>
* Numbered lists: <code># Item</code>

=== Media ===
* Images: <code>[[File:https://example.com/image.jpg|Alt Text]]</code>
